@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam classBorderColor #456575
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide empty members
title Phiếu nhập — vòng đời
[*] --> DRAFT : create
DRAFT --> DRAFT : update() thay items
DRAFT --> CONFIRMED : Manager confirm / NCC ACTIVE; stock + PURCHASE + document atomic
DRAFT --> CANCELLED : cancel trước confirm
CONFIRMED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
note bottom of CONFIRMED
Retry confirm đã CONFIRMED trả cùng kết quả.
Confirm sau CANCELLED hoặc cancel sau CONFIRMED: 409.
end note
@enduml
